SharesBurnHandlerTest
├── When setting the pre-burn hook
│   ├── When the hook setter is not the admin or owner
│   │   └── It should revert with {ComponentHelpersMixin__OnlyAdminOrOwner__Unauthorized}.
│   └── When the hook setter is the admin or owner
│       ├── It should store the pre-burn hook.
│       └── It should emit {PreBurnHookSet}.
└── When burning shares
    ├── When the burn caller is not the admin or owner
    │   └── It should revert with {ComponentHelpersMixin__OnlyAdminOrOwner__Unauthorized}.
    └── When the burn caller is the admin or owner
        ├── Given the handler is not registered as a redeem handler
        │   └── It should revert with {Shares__OnlyRedeemHandler__Unauthorized}.
        └── Given the handler is registered as a redeem handler
            ├── When any input has a zero shares amount
            │   └── It should revert with {SharesBurnHandler__Burn__ZeroShares}.
            └── When all inputs have a non-zero shares amount
                ├── Given no pre-burn hook is set
                │   ├── It should burn the shares amount from each holder.
                │   └── It should emit {SharesBurned} per input.
                └── Given a pre-burn hook is set
                    ├── It should call the pre-burn hook per input with the caller, holder, and shares amount.
                    ├── It should burn the shares amount from each holder.
                    └── It should emit {SharesBurned} per input.
